WEBVTT

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:10.940
Would you like a mature flavor
that is bitter and robust?{an}

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:14.700
Or a gently-embracing sweet flavor?{an}

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.070
Both?{an}

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.120
Delicious!{an}

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.040
Well then, for the greedy type,
I'll make a special exception.{an}

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:30.880
A mild flavor
with freshly-ground coffee and fresh milk.{an}

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:37.090
Creamy cafe au lait.{an}

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.100
Cut!{an}

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:44.190
<i>After the movie-related work was finished up,
I returned to my everyday life.</i>{an}

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.640
MR. SAIJO{an}

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.730
SASAKI
SASAKI
SASAKI
SASAKI (MISSED CALL)
SASAKI{an}

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:54.150
Good work today, Takato!{an}

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:57.950
Azumaya hasn't picked you up in a while, huh?{an}

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.200
Well, he did win the award for Best Actor.{an}

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:04.580
He's probably deluged with work right now.{an}

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:06.620
Oh, that's right.{an}

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.960
He's already set for next fall's drama.{an}

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:12.210
Oh it's this one,
with Yurie Kurokawa as the main role.{an}

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:13.170
Huh.{an}

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.090
He's playing opposite a 
major actress like that.{an}

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:19.180
They really have
great expectations for Azumaya.{an}

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:24.890
You must be lonely
not getting to hang out with him, Takato.{an}

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:26.980
Ridiculous.{an}

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:30.020
I'm relieved to finally 
get my peaceful life back.{an}

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:03.700
hug 4 "I've been framed..."{an}

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:10.210
<i>If you win the Best Actor award,
you become busy.</i>{an}

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:11.540
<i>That's only natural.</i>{an}

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.710
<i>And yet, he...</i>{an}

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.420
<i>But I'll come see you every day.</i>{an}

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:19.880
<i>"Come see me every day," what a liar!</i>{an}

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:24.430
<i>Forget coming to see me! 
He doesn't even call!</i>{an}

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.230
I'll just stop by a cake shop on the way—{an}

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.850
Good work, Takato.{an}

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.940
Good... work.{an}

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.230
Wha... Ch-Ch-Ch-Chunta?!{an}

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.780
Hey, what the hell?
Cut it out! Don't push me in here!{an}

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.240
Please get in. I'll pay you 1,000 yen later.{an}

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:47.740
Look, I'm not the kind of guy
who's fixated on 1,000 yen!{an}

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:54.460
Bastard. I haven't seen you in a while,
and here you are, kidnapping—{an}

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:57.340
Please put your seatbelt on.{an}

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:58.420
And here.{an}

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:00.670
Oh.{an}

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.640
<i>Is he angry about something?</i>{an}

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:19.900
Are you supposed to chew those up like that?{an}

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.240
Hey.{an}

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.080
Yes?{an}

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:33.460
My apartment is the other way.
Where are we going?{an}

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.840
A place I want to go with you.{an}

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.550
<i>A place he wants to go?</i>{an}

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.970
<i>But this is just a factory area.</i>{an}

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.760
Listen, Chunta...{an}

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.640
I have to work tomorrow, too.{an}

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:52.850
I know.{an}

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:53.930
So...{an}

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:55.900
So...{an}

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.690
I want to...{an}

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.610
go home.{an}

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.030
Sorry. I'm not taking you home.{an}

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.820
<i>What's he going to do to me
at a factory at night?</i>{an}

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:15.790
Damn it.{an}

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.880
Well, it's not all damned.{an}

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.050
Let's just talk it out, Chunta.{an}

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.510
- What are you mad—
- I can't take it anymore.{an}

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.010
I... can't hold back.{an}

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.060
I know your schedule, Takato.{an}

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.440
I know how busy you are.{an}

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:40.060
That's why I've been holding back
despite wanting to see you so badly.{an}

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.110
I'm sorry. I've reached my limit.{an}

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:46.740
I want to touch you, and kiss you, Takato.
I want to make love to you right now.{an}

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.450
Let me make love to you.{an}

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.870
You want to... make love?{an}

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.200
Holding back.{an}

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.040
That's what you meant?{an}

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.880
Don't dodge it, idiot!{an}

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.550
Sorry.{an}

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:04.920
Damn it!{an}

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:06.720
Don't scare me!{an}

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:10.430
I was... I was nervous
that you were mad about something.{an}

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.760
Even though I was the angry one.{an}

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.140
Did I do something?{an}

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.520
Yes, you did!{an}

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.810
You don't come to see me,
don't call or text. Go to tell!{an}

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.400
But I was holding back.{an}

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:27.740
For someone who's forever in heat like you,
holding back is actually scary!{an}

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:31.660
After being constantly in my hair,
don't suddenly vanish!{an}

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.080
Takato...{an}

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:39.920
When you say something cute like that,
I won't be able to hold back at all.{an}

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:40.830
You're okay with that?{an}

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.880
Are you asking? Then I'll say...{an}

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.920
"No way."{an}

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.970
<i>In the end, it's always like this.</i>{an}

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:56.390
<i>Because of him, my mind and body are steadily
going crazy, and I throw caution to the wind.</i>{an}

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:59.350
Takato, I really like you.{an}

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.310
I cherish you. What about you?{an}

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.910
<i>"I really like you, too."</i>{an}

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:16.580
<i>I feel as if I'd say that.</i>{an}

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.790
Oh, this is amazing.{an}

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.750
I really like it. This scenery.{an}

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.250
I'm glad.{an}

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:29.050
I love the view of the factories from here.{an}

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:34.220
Unlike the city's illumination,
these cold lights make me feel refreshed.{an}

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.680
I come here once in a while
when I want to cool my head.{an}

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:44.900
I figured I would devour you greedily
when I saw you tonight,{an}

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:49.860
but thought if we came here,
maybe we could spend time together quietly.{an}

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:53.950
In the end, I ingested a large quantity
of black mints to distract myself,{an}

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:58.120
because I knew I wouldn't be able to hold back
until we got here.{an}

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.250
So that's what you were doing.{an}

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.370
It was like from a horror movie!{an}

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.170
Horror movie?{an}

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:07.250
Sheesh. How much were you holding back?{an}

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.800
I can't begin to tell you.{an}

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:14.090
When it's regarding you,
no matter how much I try to hold back, I just can't.{an}

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:19.140
I want to be like this forever
and want you more and more.{an}

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:26.230
In that case, from now on,
come and see me sometimes.{an}

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:27.060
You don't mind?{an}

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.150
It won't annoy you?{an}

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.280
It can't be helped, right?{an}

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:35.070
My body won't be able to handle
your built-up explosions like this.{an}

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:37.660
Takato!{an}

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:40.200
Hey! What?! Cut it out!{an}

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.670
Takato...{an}

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.840
Seriously, why don't we live together?{an}

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.350
Don't try to make me say it
in the heat of the moment!{an}

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.430
I thought I could sneak that in.{an}

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.480
I'm not that easy!{an}

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.730
How many 1,000-yen bills would it take?{an}

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.230
Enough with that!{an}

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:15.700
<i>Despite myself,
I'm spending the night at his place again.</i>{an}

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.700
Nitto Talent Agency
Takato Saijo{an}

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.280
<i>I have my own mug cup now.</i>{an}

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.120
<i>My own lounging-around clothes.</i>{an}

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:25.040
<i>The way it's turned out,
I even have a reserve toothbrush here.</i>{an}

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:26.670
<i>Takato...</i>{an}

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.290
<i>Seriously, why don't we live together?</i>{an}

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.170
<i>I don't know how serious he was,</i>{an}

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.800
<i>but don't think I can
get swept off my feet that easily.</i>{an}

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:37.640
Takato.{an}

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.350
Is that the script for your next play?{an}

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.350
Mitsuya Production
Junta Azumaya{an}

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.180
<i>Just like yesterday,
he's shining brightly today, too.</i>{an}

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:47.810
Yeah. But how'd you know I was doing a play?{an}

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:48.850
I didn't tell you.{an}

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:53.360
Will you just be working
on that fall drama for a while?{an}

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.190
Yes.{an}

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.570
In the middle of the series,
there are a lot of countryside location shoots{an}

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.240
so I can't kidnap...{an}

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.620
I mean, spend time with you.{an}

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.330
Hey, what were you about to say?{an}

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.620
Don't give me, "Eh?"{an}

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:09.000
I swear, every single time, you have to stop.{an}

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.130
DIARY EXCHANGE{an}

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.130
Is that...{an}

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:15.760
Oh, right. It's one of the 
movies that you're in.{an}

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:19.640
That's the only one I couldn't see,
because I'm bad with horror movies.{an}

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.810
This brings back memories.{an}

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:26.350
I was 16 or 17, still in high school.{an}

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.440
About ten years before you met me, huh?{an}

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.820
That means you
wouldn't know about me back then.{an}

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:40.240
I feel a little sad when I think about
a time period where you didn't know me.{an}

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.330
There's no point in even thinking about that.{an}

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.250
- I guess you're right.
- Of course I am!{an}

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.580
Don't feel down over every silly thing
that you come across.{an}

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.920
I know...{an}

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.630
but I'd like to meet
the high school version of you.{an}

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.680
Yeah, well, that's impossible.{an}

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.640
<i>At this time, I had a bad feeling.</i>{an}

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:09.310
Done for the day, Takato?{an}

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:14.230
And Azumaya, thank you
for coming to pick him up.{an}

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:15.270
I'll leave him in your hands.{an}

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.360
- Great!
- Mr. Sasaki!{an}

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.450
Mr. Sasaki!{an}

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:22.740
Why does it happen like this every time?{an}

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.080
Junta!{an}

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.330
Oh, Narumiya.{an}

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:31.580
Hi! Did you have a gig in this studio today?{an}

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.580
Galaxy Agency
Ryo Narumiya{an}

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:33.960
Takato Saijo!{an}

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.590
Nice to meet you! I'm Ryo Narumiya!{an}

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:44.390
Right now I'm working with Junta
on a drama called "Witch's Drip."{an}

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.260
Junta must have already told you.{an}

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.430
Awesome! Takato in the flesh! You're so cool!{an}

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:56.190
I watch all of your movies
and TV dramas, Mr. Saijo!{an}

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.480
You've got more than just looks.{an}

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.740
<i>I predict he'll be good-looking 
once he matures,</i>{an}

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:03.110
You're really amazing and so handsome!
And your acting is incredible!{an}

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:03.110
<i>but I don't have to worry about him
as a rival for a while.</i>{an}

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:06.120
And also, you are just so totally cool!{an}

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:07.080
<i>In the first place, he doesn't seem to be
that kind of crafty type.</i>{an}

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:14.120
It's flattering to be thought of that way
by a young person.{an}

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:16.290
I hope we can work together sometime.{an}

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.090
Me, too! Thank you!{an}

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:22.420
Your uniform is Shusen Academy, right?
That brings back memories.{an}

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:26.180
Mr. Saijo, you're an alum, right?
You're famous there!{an}

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.430
Ryo, we need you to get ready.{an}

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:30.640
Sorry!{an}

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.480
Well, excuse me!{an}

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.810
You wore that uniform, huh, Takato?{an}

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:40.320
Yeah. The design hasn't changed
in all these years.{an}

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.400
Huh.{an}

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.160
Narumiya, I have a favor to ask.{an}

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:55.830
Me? What? What is it?{an}

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:59.880
Yeah, could you loan me
your spare school uniform?{an}

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:05.840
Why?{an}

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.510
Is that a no?{an}

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.730
Well...{an}

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.400
Of course not! Sure! That's an easy one!{an}

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:20.690
<i>Th-The charm level of the Sexiest Man
is in the danger zone!</i>{an}

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:24.280
Great. I'll have it dry-cleaned 
before I return it.{an}

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.530
Thanks, Narumiya.{an}

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:29.780
<i>Augh, so blinding!
I feel like I could fall in love, and I'm a man!</i>{an}

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:33.580
<i>What kind of woman
is being embraced by this man?</i>{an}

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.460
<i>That lucky lady!</i>{an}

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.340
A rental studio.{an}

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.800
Are you shooting something here?{an}

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.050
In this classroom set?{an}

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:45.630
Takato.{an}

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.720
Ta-da! Please put this on.{an}

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:57.900
I see. Now it makes sense. Right.{an}

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.400
Hey!{an}

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.400
Let go of me!{an}

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.610
So that feeling of dread I've had
for the last few days was this!{an}

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.400
Where are you going, Takato?{an}

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.610
Home! I'm going home!{an}

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.450
Please don't go home. Please put this on.{an}

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:12.540
Forget it! I'm going home!{an}

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:14.540
What are you thinking, you perverted angel?{an}

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.870
After all, you said I 
didn't have to hold back.{an}

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:19.040
I meant in small increments!{an}

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.170
Um, please listen to me.{an}

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.170
I'll pass! I swear, you're...{an}

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.130
Let go, idiot!{an}

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:27.970
Please! If you keep resisting,
you'll only get me excited!{an}

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.140
Takato, please listen to me.{an}

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:38.770
Actually, three years ago
wasn't the first time I was scouted.{an}

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:43.440
Once in middle school, 
and again in high school.{an}

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:46.490
At the time, I wasn't 
feeling it, so I refused.{an}

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:54.490
If I had entered this business earlier,
I might've been able to meet you sooner.{an}

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:58.040
I might have been able to meet you
when you were in high school.{an}

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.330
When I think about that, I get frustrated.{an}

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:10.050
I'm crazy about you, Takato, so I want you
in every stripe and don't want to waste you.{an}

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:15.720
Please give me a Takato
that I haven't seen before.{an}

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.060
Would you do that?{an}

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:20.940
Jeez, give me that!{an}

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.730
Don't get sad about crap like this!
It's annoying!{an}

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.070
- Takato.
- Look that way!{an}

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:31.280
I'll wear this for one second.
So look over there until I say it's okay.{an}

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.240
Okay!{an}

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.200
<i>What the hell? Look at that smile,
happy about something like this.</i>{an}

